01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Vacation is a 2015 American comedy road movie, written and
directed by John Francis Daley and Jonathan Goldstein.

12
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
It stars Ed Helms, Christina Applegate, Leslie Mann, Beverly
D'Angelo, Chris Hemsworth, and Chevy Chase.

13
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
It is the fifth theatrical installment of the Vacation film series.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Vacation was released on July 29, 2015, by Warner Bros.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The film received generally negative reviews from critics and
grossed $107 million on a $31 million budget.

16
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film explores themes of route 66, vacation, grand
canyon, dysfunctional family, road trip.

17
